# {{context|British|lang=en}} a payment method where [[credit]] is purchased in advance, used in small amounts and [[topped up]] when required. Used especially of [[mobile phones]] and transport ticketing.
# {{context|British|lang=en}} a mobile phone on such a [[tariff]]

